ain dragons  and earn the right to ride this feared  dragon act three takes place in the  island empire home to some of the most  feared and respected warriors years of  internal strife have left the island  prone for a hostile takeover with each  passing second the dark forces grow  stronger and the remaining allies grow  weaker head to the island Empire now and  reclaim the lands for you and your  allies free the famed Quetzalcoatl from  pirate control and score one of the  legendary dragons for your own act for  the Titans hand is now in development  and will offer more exciting new  missions and adventures be sure to check  us out at Dragons and Titans comm and  like us on Facebook to stay up to date  on the game
 

